t/verification.json"} {"question" "q-119132" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Integrating the equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{{e}^{-x/4}}{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int {e}^{-x/4}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(-4{e}^{-x/4}) \\\\  & =-2{e}^{-x/4}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now plot the solution curves by selecting different values for $C.$ The sketch below shows the solution curves for $C=0,3,6.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14029950/assets/a4b534bd33daabc94aa3c86935b1fd4c0be723fafbc418ed382716541a864293.png)" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14029950/state.json" "file_sha256" "33d31df5c002d4c09c8da6a49f2643388148a2099bf31895c57ea2ce62f4fc26" "basis" 1203 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14029950/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-119132" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14029950/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "5577438eadf86b79813dc03e2fd7e3c8cd6ef835ab14f35430977dbeeac7846d" "basis" 1203 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14029950/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-119132" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14029950/state.json" "file_sha256" "33d31df5c002d4c09c8da6a49f2643388148a2099bf31895c57ea2ce62f4fc26" "basis" 1203 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14029950/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-119132" "